{
    "title": "Ball's Path",
    "description": "Welcome to Ball's Path!\r\n\r\nBall's Path is a mesmerizing puzzle game that lets you guide a ball through a maze of circuits to reach a target location. While challenging the levels, you will face maze lines and well-designed puzzles of different difficulty levels.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n1. Fascinating levels: From simple to complex, each level is full of unique challenges and puzzles, and you need to adjust your lines to find the best path.\r\n2. Exquisite design: The game interface is simple and beautiful, and the routes and target locations are presented with distinctive graphics and colors, bringing you visual pleasure.\r\n3. Three-star reward: When you successfully pass a specific location, you will receive a three-star reward. Challenge yourself to collect all three stars and show your skills and wisdom.\r\n4. Multiple game modes: In addition to the main level challenges, you can also explore other exciting game modes. Unlock new modes and enjoy a different gaming experience.\r\n\r\nCome to the Ball's Path game store and start your line-guiding journey!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Ball&#39;s Path!<br><br>Ball&#39;s Path is a mesmerizing puzzle game that lets you guide a ball through a maze of circuits to reach a target location. While challenging the levels, you will face maze lines and well-designed puzzles of different difficulty levels.<br><br>Features:<br><br>1. Fascinating levels: From simple to complex, each level is full of unique challenges and puzzles, and you need to adjust your lines to find the best path.<br>2. Exquisite design: The game interface is simple and beautiful, and the routes and target locations are presented with distinctive graphics and colors, bringing you visual pleasure.<br>3. Three-star reward: When you successfully pass a specific location, you will receive a three-star reward. Challenge yourself to collect all three stars and show your skills and wisdom.<br>4. Multiple game modes: In addition to the main level challenges, you can also explore other exciting game modes. Unlock new modes and enjoy a different gaming experience.<br><br>Come to the Ball&#39;s Path game store and start your line-guiding journey!",
